WEBVTT

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:20.580
Pai...take this.

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:25.520
Someday, it will make you human...

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:27.090
Someday...

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:54.580
It seems there must have been
a god guiding my fate.

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:58.260
If I hadn't been rushing
to work that night...

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:01.820
Hey!

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:03.590
You're not allowed to
drive that through here!

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:05.930
Well said!

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:09.160
But if I'm late again,
Mama will kill me!

00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:11.030
Make way!

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:12.160
Make way please!

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:18.110
Make way!

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:30.210
Hey, are you OK?

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:53.710
So, you're from China?

00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:55.680
What's your name?

00:01:55.910 --> 00:01:56.640
Pai.

00:01:57.120 --> 00:01:59.110
Pai? Well I'm...

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:02.990
Oh, the outfit?

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:06.250
This is just for work,
I'm not really a transvestite.

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:11.160
Well, my mom
left when I was little.

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:14.590
And dad went to Tibet 4 years ago.
I haven't been able to contact him.

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:17.900
It didn't leave me much choice,
so that's how I ended up here.

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:21.210
That's so profound.

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:25.470
Does she really
understand Japanese?

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:31.140
She's so filthy.
Doesn't she ever bathe?

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:37.410
Hey Yakumo, what's with the girl?

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:41.350
I thought you didn't
like girls, Yakumo.

00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:46.100
Yakumo's 16 now.
He probably wants to do the nasty.

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:48.160
It's not like that!

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:49.230
Yakumo?

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:52.060
Yeah, my name's Yakumo.

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:56.110
Yakumo Fujii?

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:04.940
The son of Professor Fujii...Yakumo?

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:07.040
How do you know that?

00:03:13.390 --> 00:03:14.760
Yakumo!

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:16.160
I wanted to meet you!

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:17.790
Yakumo, I want to meet you!

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:22.920
Four years!
It took me four years from Tibet!

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:24.830
Hold on.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.670
Yakumo!

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:27.670
What's going on?

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:28.760
Idiot!

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.530
Don't make women cry in my bar!

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:34.410
Mama! Help me!

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.540
Like I know?

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:36.770
Come on!

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:09.040
Gross!

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:11.210
Professor Fujii.

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:13.210
Dad?

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:18.380
A professor?

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:20.750
Yakumo's father was a big shot.

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:24.760
He was just a fringe scientist,
obsessed with demons.

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:28.820
I understand why
my mother left him.

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:33.530
Dear Yakumo,
I hope this letter finds you well.

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:38.100
I am currently on my
way from Tibet to Kunming.

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:42.610
Unfortunately, I fear
my days are numbered.

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:51.550
The girl delivering
this letter, her name is Pai.

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:53.920
She's a kind-hearted girl
and has been taking care of me...

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:55.220
through my illness.

00:04:55.290 --> 00:05:01.160
But more importantly, Pai is
a survivor of a phantom race...

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:04.200
that uses immortality magic,
the people I've been searching for...

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:06.670
for the past seven years
called the Sanjiyan Unkara.

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:09.110
The Sanjiyan Unkara?

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:13.610
The Sanjiyan Unkara, isolated
for so long, are a completely...

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:17.480
different species from man,
and are in fact demons.

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:21.850
Though Pai doesn't yet know
the immortality techniques...

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:25.450
she claims to be nearly
three hundred years old.

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:29.290
Professor, Pai wants
to become human.

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:32.120
I believe you will.

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:33.060
Really?

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:38.930
Long ago, the Sanjiyan
discovered a way to become human...

00:05:39.140 --> 00:05:43.570
giving up their immortality
for a shorter human life span.

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:45.970
Those transformations
were successful.

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:51.840
It's likely that Pai
is the last remaining Sanjiyan.

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:54.380
How does Pai become human?

00:05:55.120 --> 00:06:02.190
Take this and find my son, Yakumo.
He'll make you a human in my place.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:05.260
For a Sanjiyan to become human,
a special artifact is needed.

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:07.660
Enclosed is a photograph
of the artifact.

00:06:07.730 --> 00:06:10.200
It's called "The Ningen No Zou"
or "Statue of Humanity".

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:15.330
I entrusted the Statue to the
Yogekisha Company in Hong Kong.

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:20.300
Please, Yakumo.
Take Pai to Hong Kong...

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:23.410
and retrieve the Statue of Humanity.

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:25.410
I beg you.

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:29.440
He's oblivious to my hardships!

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:31.350
What's this Hong Kong crap?!

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:33.050
Don't even suggest such nonsense!

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:35.360
Why should I do
anything for that filthy brat!

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:39.990
She's so precious,
I gave her a make-over.

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:42.460
Do I look okay, Yakumo?

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:44.830
So cute!

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:53.070
But that doesn't change anything!
There's no such thing as demons!

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:59.210
Breaking news, just what is this
thing that appeared out of the night...

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:00.620
in Shinjuku?

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:04.120
Takuhi!

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:09.860
Hey, what exactly is Takuhi?

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:12.530
He's a friend
who lives inside my cane!

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:15.460
Yeah well, don't introduce him to me!

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:19.140
He's in a panic,
so he's out of control!

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:21.930
If we don't calm him down
he'll cause serious damage!

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:24.370
Hey, I've got nothing
to do with this!

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:40.620
Stop! Can't you see it's me?

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:54.070
Pai!

00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:55.610
Takuhi, stop it!!

00:07:56.210 --> 00:07:57.140
Pai!!

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:10.950
This can't be...

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:13.280
Stop!

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:15.920
I'm dying...

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:20.320
You can't die, Yakumo!!!

00:08:26.170 --> 00:08:27.470
It can't be...

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:30.070
She's really not human?

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:40.280
Takuhi!

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:42.050
That is enough!
Calm down!

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:55.490
Yakumo.

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:28.120
I was being attacked by
that Takuhi bird ting.

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:31.200
My clothes are shredded,
but I don't have a scratch.

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:33.560
I wasn't dreaming...

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:35.170
Yakumo.

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:42.210
Has she been protecting me
while I was out?

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:47.380
Hong Kong...

00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:00.520
Well, here I am in Hong Kong!

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.480
I don't get it.
What's up with this mark?

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:14.110
It looks awful.

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:15.310
Yakumo!!

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:18.140
Hurry, hurry!
Let's go to Yogekisha now!

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:19.410
Yogekisha!

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:21.210
Coming!

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:26.960
What are you so giddy for?
It's disturbing.

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:31.390
Because I'm going to be human soon!
I'm so happy!

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:34.090
ls being human really that great?

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:43.800
Hey Pai, why do you want
to be a human so badly?

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:47.170
I dunno.

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:51.340
I've been longing to become human
almost three hundred years.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:53.410
But I've forgotten why.

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:55.580
A carefree individual...

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:27.450
Hey Yakumo! Look!

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.110
YOGEKISHA
Hey Yakumo! Look!

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:28.850
YOGEKISHA

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:32.280
Yeah, no mistake. This is it!

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:37.090
The Statue of Humanity is here!
I'm finally going to be human!

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:51.900
Hey you guys, wait!!

00:11:58.150 --> 00:11:59.480
The Statue of Humanity!

00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:07.850
Wait!!

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:12.630
Damn!

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:13.720
Yakumo!!

00:12:13.800 --> 00:12:15.130
Look out!

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:29.350
Yakumo!

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:40.390
He died instantly!

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:45.060
Yakumo!!

00:12:45.960 --> 00:12:46.790
Yeah.

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:50.260
Hey...

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:52.790
What happened to me?

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:56.500
Yakumo! Thank goodness!!

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:58.470
Now...wait a minute!

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:01.400
You're not hurt?

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:03.910
Seems I was hit in a good spot.

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:05.450
A good spot?!

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:08.680
The Statue of Humanity
is getting away!!

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:15.620
So you're the son
of Professor Fujii.

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:17.590
ls this it?

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:20.130
Yeah, that's it.
The Professor left it with me.

00:13:20.470 --> 00:13:22.800
It seemed to be
a very valuable piece.

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:25.230
Good thing I thought
to attach a transmitter to it.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:26.900
So who are they, anyway?

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:28.900
That's what I'd like to know.

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:31.110
What kind of business
is a Yogekisha?

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:33.340
We publish occult magazines.

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:37.640
I'm the assistant chief editor
and the only employee.

00:13:38.050 --> 00:13:39.810
This is the thief's house?

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:41.880
What a huge mansion!

00:13:42.190 --> 00:13:44.590
Antique thieves and
a millionaire's residence...

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:45.650
What's the connection?

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:48.920
If we play our cards right,
this could be a business opportunity.

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:56.190
Let's see.
They can probably afford...

00:13:56.370 --> 00:13:57.460
Ling-Ling! Hurry up!

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:10.780
Creepy place, I wonder if
there are monsters as well.

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:14.650
Listen, Yakumo.
There's no such thing as monsters!

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:18.520
But Ling-Ling, you work
as an occult expert.

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:22.090
It's just a job, so long as
it makes me money.

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:24.380
You're awful, that's fraud!

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:30.960
What is it, Pai?

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:33.430
I feel...Pai feels something.

00:14:48.850 --> 00:14:50.220
The Statue of Humanity!

00:14:51.960 --> 00:14:55.860
The Statue of Humanity,
it will make Pai human.

00:14:57.400 --> 00:14:58.380
Pai...

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:19.240
Who are you...?

00:15:19.380 --> 00:15:22.720
My name is Wong.
This is my home.

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:25.250
That doesn't seem likely
the way we found you.

00:15:25.660 --> 00:15:28.890
My husband died
in an accident a year ago.

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:31.900
Ever since then, I've seen strange
demon-like creatures...

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:34.600
and unexplainable
occurrences in my house.

00:15:34.670 --> 00:15:36.330
Tonight, they tied me up like this.

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:38.030
They're monsters!

00:15:38.270 --> 00:15:41.070
They stole the statue
from Yogekisha!

00:15:42.110 --> 00:15:45.340
Now that you mentioned it,
I've never seen that statue before.

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:52.470
It's called the Statue of Humanity,
apart from that we know nothing.

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:53.780
I see.

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:58.210
What are you doing over there?

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:01.220
Chou.

00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:03.090
Madam!

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:04.520
Who are you!

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:09.200
I'm Lee Ling-Ling of Yogekisha.

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:12.160
We're merely looking for an antique
that had been stolen from our office.

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:14.140
We have no ill intent.

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:18.440
As experts in the occult arts,
we can be of help!

00:16:19.010 --> 00:16:21.070
With expenses and our
special discount it'll be one...two...

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:23.340
It would be
three thousand won a day.

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:26.380
But, you said there were
no such things as monsters.

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:28.910
If it makes money who cares!

00:16:28.990 --> 00:16:32.320
We found your precious statue,
so don't ruin my business!

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:36.050
They appear to have no real
knowledge of the Statue of Humanity.

00:16:36.130 --> 00:16:36.790
Well then...

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:41.060
If you act now,
we'll throw in this deluxe talisman!

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:46.500
You can also purchase
a set of ten for a discount.

00:16:46.640 --> 00:16:47.830
We don't want it!

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:53.810
Very well then, we'll just to go
back to our office now.

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:55.350
That won't be necessary!

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:58.770
Chou.

00:16:58.980 --> 00:17:02.280
Shooting burglars will be considered
an act of self-defense.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:05.380
You've got to be kidding old man!

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:06.580
I'm quite serious.

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:09.450
I see.
So you're behind all of this.

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:13.250
I'd suggest you bring
something more potent next time.

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:18.600
If you had a next time...

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:25.970
Get out of here!

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:34.550
They won't escape from this house.

00:17:39.460 --> 00:17:41.080
Ling-Ling, you're pretty tough.

00:17:41.230 --> 00:17:42.660
It's from living in Hong Kong!

00:17:42.730 --> 00:17:45.200
You don't believe in monsters
but you still carry a talisman.

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:46.230
That's sneaky.

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:48.530
Whatever!
It's just business!

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:42.280
Damn! They got me!

00:18:48.990 --> 00:18:50.260
Wu...

00:18:50.430 --> 00:18:51.120
Wu!?

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:52.560
He's a Wu!

00:18:57.540 --> 00:18:58.500
Wu...

00:18:58.940 --> 00:18:59.960
Yakumo!

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:02.440
Yakumo! Hurry up!

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:05.430
What happened?
You look like you were shot.

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:08.050
Wu?

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:12.770
Hey Ling-Ling, have you
ever heard the word Wu?

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:14.780
Wu?

00:19:15.890 --> 00:19:17.080
I think so...

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:27.230
Professor Fujii!

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:37.810
Sanjiyan Unkara; a beautiful,
immortal, three-eyed demon.

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:41.970
They often seduce humans,
devouring its victim's soul.

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:44.970
With his soul devoured,
the victim dies.

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:47.880
However, his body lives on
undead and indestructible...

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:50.820
and will bear the mark
of Wu upon his forehead.

00:20:00.230 --> 00:20:02.860
Obviously it's some old wise tale.

00:20:03.270 --> 00:20:05.240
So, how do we get out here?

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:12.200
That's not true, is it?

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:17.710
You consuming my soul,
that's a lie isn't it?!

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:29.820
Impossible!

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.090
Ling-Ling!

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:47.170
Did you consume my soul, Pai?

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:53.110
It's back again!

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:11.900
Pai.

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:15.800
I have not consumed your soul!

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:27.010
Hiding in another dimension,
what cowards!

00:21:32.090 --> 00:21:34.790
Who are you?
You're not Pai?!

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:37.630
I have not consumed your soul!

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:41.700
Rather your soul and mine
are now one!

00:21:41.930 --> 00:21:44.300
My soul...and your soul?!

00:21:52.010 --> 00:21:55.040
I saved your life
in Shinjuku, as well.

00:21:55.310 --> 00:21:58.650
Now that you're immortal
that's no longer necessary.

00:21:59.820 --> 00:22:03.950
Our fates are bound.
If I die, so shall you.

00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:08.460
If I become human, you will also
become human again.

00:22:40.160 --> 00:22:42.650
Until you kill such pests
on your own...

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:44.620
you're unfit to be my Wu.

00:22:50.100 --> 00:22:50.800
Pai!

00:23:09.550 --> 00:23:10.920
Are you alright, Pai?

00:23:12.090 --> 00:23:13.150
Yakumo.

00:23:13.260 --> 00:23:15.250
If you can kill Tohchau...

00:23:15.430 --> 00:23:16.980
then what are you?

00:23:17.360 --> 00:23:21.160
I'm not sure myself, but it seems
certain we're not normal humans.

00:23:21.900 --> 00:23:24.890
Give me the Statue of Humanity
and I may let you live.

00:23:26.140 --> 00:23:26.830
No!

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:30.870
This is a very important statue!
For Pai to become human!

00:23:32.510 --> 00:23:33.570
I see.

00:23:35.150 --> 00:23:36.610
I summon Fuquai!

00:23:59.900 --> 00:24:00.770
Pai!

00:24:06.640 --> 00:24:07.440
Fuquai!

00:24:07.510 --> 00:24:09.070
Kill the brat and the girl!

00:24:14.750 --> 00:24:19.780
Yakumo!

00:24:23.390 --> 00:24:24.380
Yakumo.

00:24:24.630 --> 00:24:25.620
Come out.

00:24:26.500 --> 00:24:28.090
Come out Sanjiyan.

00:24:28.300 --> 00:24:30.460
You don't expect me
to fight this thing alone.

00:24:30.700 --> 00:24:31.690
Yakumo.

00:24:38.810 --> 00:24:40.280
Here, big monster!

00:24:40.340 --> 00:24:42.810
I won't give you the statue
unless you follow me!

00:24:42.880 --> 00:24:45.820
Don't be stupid!
Take the statue and run!

00:24:46.150 --> 00:24:49.020
You can't become
human without it!

00:24:49.820 --> 00:24:51.950
But...l don't want
you to die, Yakumo!

00:24:59.500 --> 00:25:00.160
Yakumo!

00:25:00.260 --> 00:25:01.360
Hurry! Go!

00:25:19.520 --> 00:25:20.640
That's it!

00:25:22.920 --> 00:25:24.650
This should work!

00:25:48.580 --> 00:25:49.740
Yakumo!

00:26:00.360 --> 00:26:01.350
Don't!!

00:26:01.660 --> 00:26:02.390
Shut up!

00:26:02.860 --> 00:26:05.120
It's the property of Kaiyanwang!

00:26:05.730 --> 00:26:07.890
Who is Kaiyanwang?

00:26:14.370 --> 00:26:15.340
Wu!

00:26:16.610 --> 00:26:17.470
Yakumo!

00:26:17.540 --> 00:26:18.670
Impossible!

00:26:20.950 --> 00:26:22.440
You're not escaping!

00:26:33.460 --> 00:26:34.550
Why did you?

00:26:36.730 --> 00:26:41.100
You killed my husband,
so I'm avenging him.

00:26:42.400 --> 00:26:43.300
Don't!

00:26:43.630 --> 00:26:46.100
You betrayed me, Xunquai!

00:26:54.380 --> 00:26:55.870
Don't die!

00:26:57.720 --> 00:27:01.550
I will never let the Statue of Humanity
fall into your hands!!

00:27:11.130 --> 00:27:12.620
Chou! You bastard!

00:27:13.160 --> 00:27:16.460
Have fun finding the statue!

00:27:38.060 --> 00:27:40.790
After all that trouble,
we end up with nothing.

00:27:41.690 --> 00:27:44.130
It's okay, I'm just
happy you're alright.

00:27:46.160 --> 00:27:49.890
But the Statue of Humanity is gone.

00:27:51.740 --> 00:27:53.290
Just leave it to me!

00:27:54.410 --> 00:27:57.740
Someday I'm going
to make you human!

00:27:58.240 --> 00:27:58.730
Really?

00:27:58.840 --> 00:28:00.100
Yakumo, really?

00:28:00.510 --> 00:28:01.340
Yeah!

00:28:01.410 --> 00:28:03.380
Though I'm not quite sure how yet.

00:28:03.750 --> 00:28:04.840
Yakumo!

00:28:05.080 --> 00:28:07.610
Hey, wait...you're tickling me.

00:28:07.690 --> 00:28:08.650
Hey, hey!

00:28:12.360 --> 00:28:14.950
I am terribly sorry,
Lord Kaiyanwang.

00:28:15.790 --> 00:28:19.960
I will recover the Statue of Humanity
before the time of your resurrection.

00:28:20.500 --> 00:28:21.830
I beg your forgiveness.

00:28:24.000 --> 00:28:26.330
A boy who bears the mark of the Wu...

00:28:28.340 --> 00:28:29.670
Interesting...

00:29:35.570 --> 00:29:38.440
Pai wants to go to school too
and make a gang of friends.

00:29:38.510 --> 00:29:39.810
Don't be ridiculous.

00:29:39.880 --> 00:29:42.780
Thanks to you,
I lost my gang of friends.

00:29:42.850 --> 00:29:46.540
You won't lose your gang.
The gang's all at school.

00:29:48.120 --> 00:29:51.090
3x3 Eyes, Chapter II: Yakumo.

00:29:51.860 --> 00:29:53.850
Someday, I will make you human.
